{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/extras/90451d0a58996563625ea4135c36cd19.avif?t=1767420232\" width=500 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CRYODEATH</strong> blends procedural generation, crafting, and hands-on VR survival to make every run unpredictable. Corridors reconfigure, rooms resurface, and the thing hunting you won\u2019t stalk you the same way twice. There are no perfect routes, no guaranteed safe rooms, and no guide that can truly prepare you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Inspired by classics of sci-fi horror, the game has undergone a transformative year of development. Our next update delivers the most refined, nerve-shredding version yet\u2014some creators didn\u2019t make it past the first encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scavenge. Craft. Improvise. Build gadgets to distract, disable, or barely outpace what hunts you. Movement is deliberate and physical: sound carries, light betrays, and panic makes mistakes loud. Adapt long enough to piece together what happened aboard the Evriskon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/extras/1c8c93fc1bff29c7dfe5c99fd5a5c8d5.avif?t=1767420232\" width=500 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Playthrough is unique to you\u00a0</strong>\u2014 A procedurally generated station reshuffles rooms, shafts, and choke points every run for fresh tension and pacing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Your Way</strong> \u2014 Sneak, distract, or confront using crafted gadgets and scavenged tools\u2014then improvise when plans fall apart. Stealth is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Threats</strong> \u2014 Reworked AI tracks sight, sound, and patterns. Cheap tricks won\u2019t save you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactile VR Immersion</strong> \u2014 Diegetic interfaces, physical interactions, and suffocating claustrophobia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong> \u2014 Logs, locations, and whispers in the dark reveal the Evriskon\u2019s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/extras/75d5e9dac60cb07a6ecda679d9e62e12.poster.avif?t=1767420232\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/extras/75d5e9dac60cb07a6ecda679d9e62e12.webm?t=1767420232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/extras/75d5e9dac60cb07a6ecda679d9e62e12.mp4?t=1767420232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/extras/aed7e3b56d67050efd8f5418bd1113cd.avif?t=1767420232\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reworked Movement Mechanics</strong> \u2014 Smoother locomotion, more responsive sprinting, and HMD-tied run direction for cleaner turns. Run can be used alongside thumbstick walking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smarter AI</strong> \u2014 Improved pathing, Sharper senses and decision-making; harder to shake once they have your scent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map Generation 2.0</strong> \u2014 New shaft types, higher encounter probability, and richer route variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overhauled Encounters</strong> \u2014 Clearer telegraphs, nastier mid-chase surprises, and better escalation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quality-of-Life</strong> \u2014 Cleaner UI cues, improved inventory/crafting flow, and expanded comfort options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW: Hunt Mode</strong> \u2014 A new mode with a new ending (unlocked after completing the campaign).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW: Sidearm</strong> \u2014 A new gun to expand your last-resort options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance Pass</strong> \u2014 Better framerate and stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UI Overhaul</strong> \u2014 Cleaner, more readable feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOADS OF BUGS FIXED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/extras/882d8001b9c9264018440ebbf4536f2a.avif?t=1767420232\" width=500 height=150 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Want To See Some Reactions?</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>We feature up-to-date gameplay from content creators in the discord.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Are You a Content Creator?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Grab our free Content Creator Media Pack in Discord\u2014complete with real in-game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> sounds your chat can trigger to mess with your head as you explore the desolate station.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Have You Got Stuck?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Our Discord community is genuinely helpful - Ask Questions or Help New Players get on their feet.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2205010?t=1767420232","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767420232","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/299a8d7aae34252032317a752a68fd5067f84234/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767420232","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205010/299a8d7aae34252032317a752a68fd5067f84234/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767420232","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains violence, plays on your phobias."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s